OL,3,GNEWSANature reserve to double in size,
OL,4,Athanks to gift
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nature reserve will double in size
OL,7,Fdue to a generous gift left in a will,
OL,8,Fa wildlife trust has said.
OL,10,FThe donation has secured more land at
OL,11,FJackson's Coppice and Marsh Nature
OL,12,FReserve near Eccleshall, Staffordshire.
OL,14,FAn area of wet woodland and marsh has
OL,15,Fbeen acquired alongside pastureland
OL,16,Fsouth of the River Sow. Public
OL,17,Ffootpaths and a scheme to slow the flow
OL,18,Fof the river in heavy rainfall are
OL,19,Fbeing planned.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
