OL,3,GNEWSANature reserve to double in size,
OL,4,Athanks to gift
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is fantastic news for wildlife
OL,7,Fand a wonderful example of how gifts in
OL,8,Fwills can create lasting change for
OL,9,Fnature," Jeff Sim of Staffordshire
OL,10,FWildlife Trust said. The donation was
OL,11,Fmade by trust supporter David Aldred.
